    "abstract": "Parts figure for the forward cargo door latching mechanism, showing the eight hook stations, the latching web, the load-sharing carriage and the shear ties, with the pre and post carriage effectivity split.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the latching items of the forward cargo door, including the hook stations, the latching web and the items introduced with the load-sharing carriage.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the door inner face with the eight hook stations numbered from the forward end. Sheet 2 shows the carriage detail at a single station; the eight stations are identical. Item 10 and item 10A are alternates: item 10 is the latching web with the carriage rail integral and item 10A is the earlier web with the fixed hook seats. A door cannot carry a mixture of the two. Item 20 does not exist on pre-carriage aircraft."
    },
